&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1so3w4n&quot; data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Make complex investment decisions easy for customers to understand: what they are doing, why it matters, what the implications are, and what happens next.&lt;/li&gt;
