&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w4dhvm&quot; data-start=&quot;3282&quot; data-end=&quot;3417&quot;&gt;Ability to understand complex product, legal, business, and technical constraints and translate them into clear customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
